37. Find Customer Retention Month-over-Month

Common Product Company Question

Customers active in both Month-1 and Month-2.

PySpark:

m1 = df.filter("month='2025-01'")
m2 = df.filter("month='2025-02'")

retained = m1.join(
m2,
"customer_id"
)

SQL:

SELECT DISTINCT a.customer_id
FROM jan_sales a
JOIN feb_sales b
ON a.customer_id=b.customer_id;
